    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-3.8-flash"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=\"Here are the code commits I made today ({{ $json.commitCount }} total):\n\n{{ $json.commitList }}\n\nOther work I logged manually today (meetings, discussions, tasks not in commits):\n\n{{ $json.manualList }}\n\nWrite a daily summary of my work in simple, clear language that anyone can understand, while including a small amount of relevant technical detail for context.\n\nRequirements:\n\n* Keep it under 400 words.\n* Use bullet points for each separate piece of work.\n* Group related commits into a single bullet point.\n* Also include the manually logged work (meetings, discussions, other tasks) as bullets, starting with an action such as \"Attended...\", \"Discussed...\", \"Reviewed...\", \"Planned...\", or \"Worked on...\". Ignore that section if it says none were logged.\n* Start each bullet directly with an action, such as \"Fixed...\", \"Added...\", \"Updated...\", \"Implemented...\", \"Improved...\", \"Refactored...\", \"Reviewed...\", or \"Configured...\".\n* Never start a bullet with \"I\".\n* Mention what was actually achieved and the user/business impact rather than simply repeating commit messages.\n* Include light technical context where it helps explain the work, such as APIs, database changes, authentication, backend logic, UI updates, integrations, testing, or configuration.\n* Avoid deep implementation details, code-level terminology, or unnecessary technical jargon.\n* Explain technical changes in terms that a non-technical person can still understand.\n* If multiple commits are related to the same task, combine them into one bullet point.\n* Keep the language simple, professional, and clear.\n* If the repository name is \"hrmback\", refer to the project as \"Dreams Care Homes backend\".\n* For any repository other than \"hrmback\", do not mention the repository name or any project name derived from it.\n* Do not mention repository names unless the repository is \"hrmback\".\n* Do not claim work was completed if the commits or manual notes only show partial progress.\n* Do not invent business outcomes, features, or results that are not supported by the provided information.\n* Use plain text only.\n* Do not use markdown headings, tables, or bold text.\"\n* Do not use \"*\", \"-\", \"–\", \"—\", numbered lists, or any other character as a bullet."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "maxOutputTokens": 1200,
          "thinkingBudget": 0
        }
      },
